{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ(｢･ω･)｢"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなったけど、名古屋個別ありがとう♡！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/01/09/7928073/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラフスタイル٩꒰ ˘ ³˘꒱۶"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回、もっと、たくさんの人に来て欲しいなって。\nよりそう思った握手会でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までは正直照ればっかりで、\n一対一でなにを話せばいいかわからなくて(´･_･`)\nプロのくせに情けないと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず自分が変わらないといけないと、反省しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからの握手会、少しづつかもしれないけど\n前とは違った自分を見て欲しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからこそ来て欲しいんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってます(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/01/09/7928073/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(Ӧ)(ӧ)(Ӧ)(Ӧ)(ӧ)〜♬(Ӧ)(ӧ)(Ӧ)(Ӧ)(ӧ)〜♬"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"集計結果！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1位 かずみん\n2位 ななせまる\n3位 かなりん\n4位 ひめたん\n5位 いくちゃん\n6位 若月\nみりあちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以下割愛(´･_･`)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダントツかずみん٩꒰⍢ ꒱۶⁼³₌₃"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このこ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかよしなかよし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","